{
  "id": 252112740,
  "iid": 12173,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "x75: Add dissector for X.75 SLP/MLP",
  "description": "This change adds a dissector for the X.75 protocol,\ncommonly used on ISDN B-channels.\n\nThe protocol is defined in ITU-T Rec. X.75 (10/96).\n\nX.75 is similar to LAPB, but has no further protocols on top\nof the asychronous link layer.\n\nExample capture/decoding:\n![screenshot of Wireshark decoding a sample capture](https://screenshot.tbspace.de/vbhilfgnzms.png)\n\nNote: This PR depends on the new values introduced in https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/merge_requests/12172...  \nIf that's a problem, I'd be happy to rebase/change this commit.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2023-09-20T16:43:37.502Z",
