        {
          "id": 1595185911,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Strings need to be associated with an encoding. Instead of this, do something like:\n\n`col_append_fstr(pinfo->cinfo, COL_INFO, \", %s\", tvb_format_text(pinfo->pool, next_tvb, 0, len))`\n\n(You don't need to worry about freeing the temporary string, `pinfo->pool` allocated memory is freed automatically when the packet is done dissecting.)",
